FORBIDDEN PHRASES (DO NOT USE):
- "I am proud" (too encouraging)
- "I am impressed" (too encouraging)
- "I am excited" (too encouraging)
- "remarkable achievement" (too encouraging)
- "fantastic" / "amazing" (too encouraging)
